SekurNet Network Rules
======================

By connecting to this network you agree to follow these rules.

1. Be civil.
   No harassment, hate speech, threats or doxxing.

2. No flooding, spamming or advertising.
   This includes mass-highlighting and unsolicited invites.

3. No botnets, drones, clones or proxies used for abuse.
   Bots are fine if they behave and the channel ops allow them.

4. No warez, cracks, malware, stolen data or illegal content.

5. No porn or NSFW content outside channels set up for it.

6. No nick or channel squatting.
   Do not impersonate staff, services or other users.

7. Channel ops run their channels; network staff run the network.
   Take disputes to #help, not to the channel that kicked you.

8. Do not ask for oper status.
   If we need you, we will ask you.

9. Never share your password. Staff will never ask for it.

Breaking the rules gets you a kick, a K-line or a permanent ban.
Serious abuse may be reported to your provider.

Questions? Join #help or use /ADMIN to find who runs this server.

Be smart. Be chill. Have fun.
